# [SECURITY] Emergency Governance: Delegate GTC to Veto Multisig
This is an extension to the "\[SECURITY] Emergency Governance: Temporary Transition to Multisig Execution" proposal that delegates the 12,508,498.0957571 GTC in the Gitcoin DAO treasury to 0x5743e35477363241300fcedc2f5eb0195f300817 - which is a 4/5 multisig that can act as a veto for  treasury attacks.  &#x20;

The delegates at 0x5743e35477363241300fcedc2f5eb0195f300817 would not weigh in on any vote except an attack on the treasury.&#x20;

This action serves as a veto on any proposal thats below 13m GTC, increasing the cost of an attack to be at least (13m GTC + 3m GTC in currently active stewards) = 16m GTC.  &#x20;

# 2025 Grants Lab Budget
This vote serves to ratify [this Snapshot vote](https://snapshot.org/#/s:gitcoindao.eth/proposal/0xd2b0853e328b3bdef16a526b2291a6e8a6897826dfca2d5d7a220f90ae1789f5 "Snapshot vote") which approved the movement of $5,232,330 USD (8,759,999.20 GTC) from the Gitcoin Treasury to the Grants Lab multisig. We will request 50% of this now and remaining 50% before the end of H1.&#x20;

This budget proposal covers the full year of 2025. The budget requested is $4,831,109 with anticipated revenues of $2,323,027. We will also request $401,221 for reserves (calculating total reserves at 20% with current treasury of $565,000.)

# 2025 Gitcoin DAO Budget
This vote serves to ratify [this Snapshot vote](https://snapshot.org/#/s:gitcoindao.eth/proposal/0x7d5fe022bd18a1caac9528c56d4a2a47b5d6692e71168c166def489bf19b5ab6 "Snapshot vote") which approved the movement of $808,098 from the Gitcoin Treasury to the DAO multisig.&#x20;

This seeks funding for DAO operations through 2025 (January - December), including the Gitcoin Grants Program operations. The DAO 2025 Strategy presents an integrated approach to governance, builder engagement, and ecosystem growth, focusing on progressive decentralization and global expansion. We are requesting $808,098 from the treasury ($673,415 + 20% reserves) to execute this vision.
